etting up this alert is processed in accordance with our Privacy Notice I would like to receive email communication from jobs.ac.uk relating to Company News I would like to receive email communication from jobs.ac.uk relating to Conferences, Meetings and Events Save this job Login to Save Job Max Saved Jobs Reached × Max Saved Jobs Reached A maximum of 500 Saved Jobs can be created against your account. Please remove an existing Saved Job in order to add a new Saved Job. Manage Saved Jobs × Save Job Please sign in or register for an account to save a job. Sign In Register More jobs from Sheffield Hallam University Lecturer in English and Drama Education Lecturer in Computing Education Lecturer in Child Nursing (0.4 FTE) Lecturer in Chemistry Researcher - Sustainable Futures and Supply Chain Product Development Engineer (Materials & Data) (KTP Associate @ SBD Apparel) Show all jobs for this employer … More jobs like this Research Fellow Marshall Aid Commemoration Commission Research Fellow A in Metal Recovery Teaching Associate in Engineering Mathematics and Technology Teacher of Engineering Join in and follow us Copyright © jobs.ac.uk 1998 - 2026 Find a Job Find PhDs Career Advice Jobs by Email Advertise a Job About Us Contact Us Find a Job Find PhDs Career Advice Jobs by Email Advertise a Job About Us Contact Us Terms of use Privacy Policy Cookie Policy Accessibility Statement Terms of use Privacy Policy Cookie Policy Accessibility Statement Copyright © jobs.ac.uk 1998 - 2026 IE11 Trigger Browser Upgrade Recommended jobs.ac.uk has been optimised for the latest browsers. For the best user experience, we recommend viewing jobs.ac.uk on one of the following:"
